   "text": "International College of Manitoba - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nInternational College of Manitoba\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nLocated in the vibrant Canadian city of Winnipeg, the International College of Manitoba is a pathway college with a choice of programs aimed at providing students with a ‘soft landing' to living and studying in Canada. Its programs and support system are designed to help students as they make the transition to living in Canada. Upon successful completion of the UTP Stage II program, students can progress to the second year of one of the many undergraduate degree courses at the University of Manitoba.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:02\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n27/03/2026 08:52\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nCanada\nYearly Fees\nMax: CA$19,660.00\nMin: CA$18,708.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n16%\n650 of 4,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1887\nCampus(es)\nWinnipeg\nCountry\nCanada\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OBBv2yxThqM\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
